DSHOptimizeMosire · dsh-goal-confirm
====================================

This package adds a confirmation gate in front of automatic goal rounds in
DeepSeek Harness (DSH) Web profiles. It is not an official DeepSeek package
and is not affiliated with or endorsed by DeepSeek.

Official extension points only
------------------------------
The plugin is implemented entirely with public DSH extension points:

- the `agent/pre-step` waterfall event (a `prepend` listener holds the step);
- the `ctx.goals` service (`get` / `clear` / `pause`);
- the `ctx.userQuestions` service (`ask`).

No DSH source code was copied into this package. The gate is a Host plugin
loaded through a bundle patch and does not modify any DSH package.

Reused UI
---------
The question card rendered on the Web side is the official
`@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-user-questions` package shipped with DSH
(MIT License, Copyright DeepSeek). This bundle ships no browser code of its
own; it reuses that card exactly as installed.

Local porting notes live in the repository under
docs/agents/02-调研-goal续轮确认门.md and .superpowers/sdd/2026-10-17-goal-confirm/
(the latter is a local, non-versioned record).
